                <p class="pcard-team">Harshith Sai Mannaru, Tirth Suba, Aarnav Gutti</p>
                <p class="pcard-desc">Five agents walk a graph of your evidence like ants, marking connections as they go, and hand research teams the reasoning chains behind a theory instead of a confident paragraph.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="pcard-actions">
                <a class="pcard-devpost" href="https://devpost.com/software/trails-f0w8oc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DEVPOST →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Fintech -->
